[273.742386, "o", "A total of 14 unique ALMA Member Observation Unit Sets (MOUS) targeting HH 212 were found in Band 6 and/or Band 7 with spatial resolution better than 1 arcsecond. Of these, 3 include Band 6 data and 11 include Band 7 data. The best spatial resolution achieved ranges from 0.0148 to 0.8028 arcsec across the sample, reflecting a range of ALMA configurations from moderate to very high angular resolution. These public, science-grade observations span multiple ALMA projects and provide a rich dataset for studying the HH 212 protostellar outflow system at sub-arcsecond scales.\r\n"]
[273.744262, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@f1b01bdb67bf:/app# "]
